OL,3,GNEWSAWill Christmas market 'rest day'
OL,4,Abe detrimental for traders?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs traders set up their festive stalls
OL,7,Ffor the York Christmas markets,
OL,8,Fexcitement is in the air.
OL,10,F2026 is the first year the market will
OL,11,Fbe paused on Tuesdays to give the city
OL,12,Fa "rest day" from the bustle of the
OL,13,Fnotoriously busy event.
OL,15,FFor some stallholders, this will give
OL,16,Fstaff a welcome break, but others fear
OL,17,Fa six-day week will have a
OL,18,F"detrimental" impact on trade and turn
OL,19,FYork into a "ghost town" on Tuesdays.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
