OL,3,GNEWSAWill Christmas market 'rest day'
OL,4,Abe detrimental for traders?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe idea is being trialled by City of
OL,7,FYork Council, in a bid to improve
OL,8,Faccessibility for residents and allow
OL,9,FBlue Badge holders to park in the city
OL,10,Fcentre during the event.
